<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>Fleet spent in parts. Time controls: available, cost-free.<\gray>
?else
<gray>The budget ran out. Next time, count what each post needs before sending it.<\gray>
?end
